          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Treadmill <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">Maintenance Checklist</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Every task a home treadmill needs, organised by interval rather than by component. The whole year totals under an hour, and it roughly doubles the machine’s life.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
